13, 13, 13);">mission-ruelle.png.</span></code><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);"> au lieu de </span><code class="Code-LNMR8q" data-d-component="code"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">mission-ruelle-matin.png</span></code><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">.</span></p><h3 class="TextBase-kDAqPL Title-ij922C" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="title" data-d-size="md" data-d-weight="semibold"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);"><strong class="Emphasis-BHzYtQ">2. Le chien et la nourriture</strong></span></h3><p class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">Les fichiers </span><code class="Code-LNMR8q" data-d-component="code"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">mission-chien</span></code><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);"> et </span><code class="Code-LNMR8q" data-d-component="code"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">mission-nourriture</span></code><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);"> n'ont pas de miniature. Je vois également deux dossiers </span><code class="Code-LNMR8q" data-d-component="code"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">mission-chien_files</span></code><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);"> et </span><code class="Code-LNMR8q" data-d-component="code"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">mission-nourriture_files</span></code><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">.</span></p><p class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">Tu as probablement enregistré une page web plutôt que l'image elle-même.</span></p><h3 class="TextBase-kDAqPL Title-ij922C" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="title" data-d-size="md" data-d-weight="semibold"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);"><strong class="Emphasis-BHzYtQ">3. Afficher les extensions des fichiers</strong></span></h3><p class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">Dans ton explorateur Windows :</span></p><p class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline=""><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);"><strong class="Emphasis-BHzYtQ">Affichage → Afficher → Extensions de noms de fichiers.</strong></span></span></p><p class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">En néerlandais : </span><span class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline=""><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);"><strong class="Emphasis-BHzYtQ">Beeld → Weergeven → Bestandsextensies.</strong></span></span></p><p class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">Ensuite, on doit obtenir exactement ceci :</span></p><div class="TableFrame-goa0AO" data-d-column-sizing="auto" data-d-component="table"><div class="TableViewport-RIVuau" data-d-table-viewport="true"><table class="Table-s3u64B" data-d-column-sizing="auto" data-d-dividers="" style="table-layout: auto;"><tbody><tr data-d-component="table-row"><th data-d-component="table-cell" data-d-valign="start" scope="col"><p class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run">Nom du fichier</span></p></th><th data-d-component="table-cell" data-d-valign="start" scope="col"><p class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run">État apparent</span></p></th></tr><tr data-d-component="table-row"><td data-d-component="table-cell" data-d-valign="start"><p class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><code class="Code-LNMR8q" data-d-component="code"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run">mission-ruelle-matin.png</span></code></p></td><td data-d-component="table-cell" data-d-valign="start"><p class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-inline="" style="color: var(--color-text-warning);"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run">À renommer</span></span></p></td></tr><tr data-d-component="table-row"><td data-d-component="table-cell" data-d-valign="start"><p class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><code class="Code-LNMR8q" data-d-component="code"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run">mission-ruelle-midi.png</span></code></p></td><td data-d-component="table-cell" data-d-valign="start"><p class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-inline="" style="color: var(--color-text-success);"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run">OK</span></span></p></td></tr><tr data-d-component="table-row"><td data-d-component="table-cell" data-d-valign="start"><p class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><code class="Code-LNMR8q" data-d-component="code"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run">mission-ruelle-soir.png</span></code></p></td><td data-d-component="table-cell" data-d-valign="start"><p class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-inline="" style="color: var(--color-text-warning);"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run">Image à refaire</span></span></p></td></tr><tr data-d-component="table-row"><td data-d-component="table-cell" data-d-valign="start"><p class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><code class="Code-LNMR8q" data-d-component="code"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run">mission-ruelle-nuit.png</span></code></p></td><td data-d-component="table-cell" data-d-valign="start"><p class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-inline="" style="color: var(--color-text-success);"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run">OK</span></span></p></td></tr><tr data-d-component="table-row"><td data-d-component="table-cell" data-d-valign="start"><p class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><code class="Code-LNMR8q" data-d-component="code"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run">mission-chien.png</span></code></p></td><td data-d-component="table-cell" data-d-valign="start"><p class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-inline="" style="color: var(--color-text-danger);"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run">À vérifier</span></span></p></td></tr><tr data-d-component="table-row"><td data-d-component="table-cell" data-d-valign="start"><p class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><code class="Code-LNMR8q" data-d-component="code"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run">mission-nourriture.png</span></code></p></td><td data-d-component="table-cell" data-d-valign="start"><p class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-inline="" style="color: var(--color-text-danger);"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run">À vérifier</span></span></p></td></tr><tr data-d-component="table-row"><td data-d-component="table-cell" data-d-valign="start"><p class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><code class="Code-LNMR8q" data-d-component="code"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run">mission-eau.png</span></code></p></td><td data-d-component="table-cell" data-d-valign="start"><p class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-inline="" style="color: var(--color-text-success);"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run">OK</span></span></p></td></tr><tr data-d-component="table-row"><td data-d-component="table-cell" data-d-valign="start"><p class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><code class="Code-LNMR8q" data-d-component="code"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run">mission-soins.png</span></code></p></td><td data-d-component="table-cell" data-d-valign="start"><p class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-inline="" style="color: var(--color-text-success);"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run">OK</span></span></p></td></tr><tr data-d-component="table-row"><td data-d-component="table-cell" data-d-valign="start"><p class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><code class="Code-LNMR8q" data-d-component="code"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run">mission-regard.png</span></code></p></td><td data-d-component="table-cell" data-d-valign="start"><p class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-inline="" style="color: var(--color-text-success);"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run">OK</span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="Edges-nCUHEi" style="left: 0px; top: 0px; width: 1174px; height: 382px;"></div></div><p class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">Les extensions étant masquées, je ne peux pas encore confirmer les noms exacts.</span></p><p class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline=""><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);"><strong class="Emphasis-BHzYtQ">Ne touche plus au HTML pour l'instant.</strong></span></span><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);"> On va d'abord régler les images.</span></p></div></div></div><div class="contents"></div></div></div></div></div></div><span hidden=""></span></div></div><div class="actionRow-nqq