pt-selection-conversation-id="6b05a213-b454-83ed-acc7-f0231ed77b2c" data-chatgpt-selection-message-id="4708b828-6f01-4c0c-8972-17521bd5958d"><span hidden=""></span><div data-selected-text-overlay-target="_r_fa2_" dir="auto" data-markdown-text-style="assistant-message" class="MarkdownRoot-rZKhxa [&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 [&amp;&gt;ol:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;ul:first-child]:mt-0" style="--markdown-link-color: currentColor;"><div class="my-4 first:mt-0 last:mb-0 empty:hidden" data-dil-source-message-id="4708b828-6f01-4c0c-8972-17521bd5958d" data-chatgpt-copy-reference="0" data-markdown-copy="contents"><div class="[--entity-prose-inset:0px]"><div hidden=""></div><div class="relative PortalBoundary-TFj9W2 Renderer-ojZscX" data-theme="light" style="--puik-portal-zoom: 1;"><div dir="auto" class="DilRenderer-temL23 DilResponseRoot-fdCmoC Reveal-eHl_0F" data-dil-response="" data-d-direction="col" data-dil-message-id="4708b828-6f01-4c0c-8972-17521bd5958d"><p class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run">Les noms des fichiers téléchargés sont corrects ! Par contre, il manque toujours </span><code class="Code-LNMR8q" data-d-component="code"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run">mission-ruelle-matin.png</span></code><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run">.</span></p><p class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run">Pour le chien et la nourriture, clique sur les noms bleus dans ta liste de téléchargements :</span></p><ul class="List-bYalj1" data-d-component="list" data-d-marker="bullet" data-d-marker-layout="native" style="--d-list-row-gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 0); gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 0);"><li class="Item-EWTmaR" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-DbD0Oj"><div class="Label-qdSQ_4" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><code class="Code-LNMR8q" data-d-component="code"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run">mission-chien.png</span></code></p></div></div></li><li class="Item-EWTmaR" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-DbD0Oj"><div class="Label-qdSQ_4" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><code class="Code-LNMR8q" data-d-component="code"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run">mission-nourriture.png</span></code></p></div></div></li></ul><p class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run">Est-ce que les images s'ouvrent correctement ou est-ce que tu obtiens un message d'erreur ?</span></p><p class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run">Si elles s'ouvrent correctement, il faudra vérifier qu'elles sont bien présentes sur GitHub.</span></p><p class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run">Pour l'image du soir, je vais devoir refaire le décor sans les contours arrondis. C'est un défaut de l'image générée, pas du code.</span></p></div></div></div><div class="contents"></div></div></div></div></div></div><span hidden=""></span></div></div><div class="actionRow-nqqZbm mt-1.5 flex turn-action-controls min-h-5 min-w-0 max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-wrap items-center justify-start gap-0.5 browser:-ms-0.5 browser:mt-3 electron:-translate-x-1 extension:-translate-x-1.5 [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-2 [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-ring [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-offset-0 [--side-tooltip:bottom]"><div class="flex items-center gap-0.5 browser:gap-0 min-h-5 min-w-0 