;ul:first-child]:mt-0" style="--markdown-link-color: currentColor;"><div class="my-4 first:mt-0 last:mb-0 empty:hidden" data-dil-source-message-id="530eae0a-a893-41ce-9f06-389f688ec04b" data-chatgpt-copy-reference="0" data-markdown-copy="contents"><div class="[--entity-prose-inset:0px]"><div hidden=""></div><div class="relative PortalBoundary-TFj9W2 Renderer-ojZscX" data-theme="light" style="--puik-portal-zoom: 1;"><div dir="auto" class="DilRenderer-temL23 DilResponseRoot-fdCmoC Reveal-eHl_0F" data-dil-response="" data-d-direction="col" data-dil-message-id="530eae0a-a893-41ce-9f06-389f688ec04b"><p class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run">Voilà, le problème est confirmé : </span><span class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline=""><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run"><strong class="Emphasis-BHzYtQ">l'image est corrompue.</strong></span></span><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run"> Ce n'est pas un problème de HTML ou de CSS.</span></p><p class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run">On va refaire quatre images, séparément :</span></p><ul class="List-bYalj1" data-d-component="list" data-d-marker="bullet" data-d-marker-layout="native" style="--d-list-row-gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 0); gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 0);"><li class="Item-EWTmaR" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-DbD0Oj"><div class="Label-qdSQ_4" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><code class="Code-LNMR8q" data-d-component="code"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run">mission-chien.png</span></code><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run"> — chien sur fond transparent.</span></p></div></div></li><li class="Item-EWTmaR" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-DbD0Oj"><div class="Label-qdSQ_4" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><code class="Code-LNMR8q" data-d-component="code"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run">mission-nourriture.png</span></code><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run"> — gamelle sur fond transparent.</span></p></div></div></li><li class="Item-EWTmaR" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-DbD0Oj"><div class="Label-qdSQ_4" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><code class="Code-LNMR8q" data-d-component="code"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run">mission-ruelle-matin.png</span></code><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run"> — décor manquant.</span></p></div></div></li><li class="Item-EWTmaR" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-DbD0Oj"><div class="Label-qdSQ_4" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-thread-reading-passage=""><code class="Code-LNMR8q" data-d-component="code"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run">mission-ruelle-soir.png</span></code><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run"> — décor rectangulaire, sans contours transparents.</span></p></div></div></li></ul><p class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run">On garde les mêmes noms pour ne plus devoir modifier le HTML. Cette fois, vérifie que chaque image s'ouvre correctement avant de l'ajouter sur GitHub.</span></p></div></div></div><div class="contents"></div></div></div></div></div></div><span hidden=""></span></div></div><div class="actionRow-nqqZbm mt-1.5 flex turn-action-contro